    "Description": "The kernel packages contain the Linux kernel, the core of any Linux operating system.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* kernel: openvswitch: defer tunnel netdev_put to RCU release (CVE-2026-31678)\n\n* kernel: dm_early_create: fix freeing used table on dm_resume failure (CVE-2026-72102)\n\n* kernel: Bluetooth: mgmt: fix UAF in pair command cancellation (CVE-2026-74510)\n\nBug Fix(es) and Enhancement(s):\n\n* qemu-kvm: error: failed to set MSR 0xc0000102 to 0xff4547ceb1600000 [RHEL.9.4.z] (JIRA:RHEL-120065)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
